.TH "PERCH-DOCTOR" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-doctor \- check the database, TLS, S3, and mxRaven connectivity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch doctor [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Run integrity and connectivity checks for SQLite/FTS5, TLS certificate files, DNS, S3, and configured mxRaven listeners. The command exits non\-zero when a check fails.
.SH NOTES
.IP \(bu 2
Run as the same user that runs serve so file permissions match.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config <value>
configuration file (default: ~/.config/perch/perch.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch doctor \-\-config /etc/perch/perch.yaml
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1)
